# Modernize Dashboard Graph

Simplify and enhance the main trend chart on the dashboard to show consolidated Scope 1 and Scope 2 emissions with a premium visual style.

## Proposed Changes

### Dashboard

#### [MODIFY] [dashboard.js](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.js)
- Update [processEmissionsData](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.js#178-240) to aggregate total CO2e for Scope 1 and Scope 2 per year.
- Simplify [renderTrendChart](file:///c:/Users/samsung/Desktop/ghg%20old/public/dashboard.js#300-432) to show only two datasets: Scope 1 Total and Scope 2 Total.
- Implement premium styling for the chart:
    - Smooth area charts with vertical gradients.
    - Improved tooltips and legend.
    - Simplified grid and axis labels.
- Remove separate CO2 and CH4 lines as requested.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- Check the dashboard to ensure the trend chart now displays two consolidated lines/areas for Scope 1 and Scope 2.
- Verify the chart aesthetics match the modern dashboard theme.
- Confirm the data values match the aggregated totals.
